Title | Share a calendar event
Subtitle | Invite a colleague to an existing Calendar event.
Normal | This guide shows how to invite someone to an event you **already** created.
Heading1 | Prerequisites
Normal num=2/0 | A Mac signed in to iCloud
Normal num=2/0 | An existing event
Heading1 | Open the event
Heading2 | 1. Click **Calendar** in the Dock
Normal | [image 609600x381000]
Heading2 | 2. Double-click the *Team sync* event
Normal | [image 609600x381000]
Normal | The event opens in its own window.
Normal shd=E8F5E9 | **Tip: **You can also select the event and press `⌘O` to open it.
Heading1 | Invite people
Heading2 | 3. Type the guest's email in **Add Invitees**
Normal | [image 304800x190500]
Normal | Separate several guests with commas.
Normal num=3/0 | Guests get an email invite
Normal num=3/0 | You can remove them later
Heading2 | 4. Right-click the guest and choose **Send Email**
Normal | [image 609600x381000]
Heading2 | 5. Press `⌘S` to save
Normal | [image 304800x190500]
Normal shd=E8F0FE | **Note: **Guests see changes after they [refresh their calendar](https://support.apple.com/guide/calendar/welcome/mac).
